cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: process-flow
abstract: >-
  A channel viewer for Nextflow pipelines. One command runs a pipeline's test
  and writes a self-contained HTML page beside its MultiQC report: every
  process, operator and channel, what each channel carried in that run (meta
  keys, items, provenance, from Nextflow's data lineage), and the conditions
  under which each element exists, read from the pipeline's code or from a
  model its authors published. For authors, an Analyser proves those
  conditions over an adaptive matrix of preview runs.
type: software
